217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Furthermore, a consumer is more likely to repeatedly purchase premium-priced products since the restrictive barrier to purchase continues to solidify their perception of quality and exclusivity. Additionally, alternative options will become less appealing and eventually build habits integrating Picea into their regular purchasing patterns. The superb flavour and premium packaging also provide the social validation these consumers seek, and through this approval, brand loyalty will begin to grow. )
