<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Since the process of producing a Picea is more delicate than competitors, due to the utilisation of local produce and sustainable packaging, the accessibility of it will also be less available. However, this positively represents the product as unique and not available to everyone which supports the exclusivity and prestige associated with a purchase.)
