255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Through using recyclable paperboard cartons the focus on sustainability is highlighted by reducing the wastage and increasing the recyclability of products, supporting a greener future \(GoforGreen 2023\). This decision will reduce environmental impact whilst increasing both brand image and sales. The simplistic design with light brown symbolises a cookie with warmth and richness suggesting a high-quality product.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
