261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As the target market of premium indulgers is dominated by wealthy minded individuals, the promotion strategies will aim to appeal to their moral entitlement serving as a means to appear special between peers. The simplicity of messaging aligns with a sense of sophistication and elegance that create a sense of luxury. This advertisement is very memorable and eye-catching to potential consumers. The contrasting colours of black and gold further enhance the premium targeting. The black gives a sense of elegance and the gold symbolises wealth, luxury and success \(Cherry 2022\). These pamphlets will initially be placed in mailboxes of individuals living in areas of higher socioeconomic status this creating a sense of importance by exclusivity. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
